        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1d92f231-b70e-4423-9699-912776b17dca\",\"review_text\":\"My app doesn't want to work and I can't search anything\"},{\"review_id\":\"44e44069-c1ed-4ce1-bfa4-1e6caaa31dc6\",\"review_text\":\"It's getting awful I hate it I can't choose my favorite song I don't want to hear songs here again\"},{\"review_id\":\"1725da80-94f6-4874-9cfe-5cb11d011e9c\",\"review_text\":\"Find the app to be very easy to use and reliable which is very important to me thank you\"},{\"review_id\":\"faba6d40-57ee-421b-9be9-a735d2959fb6\",\"review_text\":\"More worse after new Ad update, which can't even let you skip songs, select with your choice, so greedy man, how much you gonna earn\"},{\"review_id\":\"3e1f46cb-ec60-4c9c-9057-0b84c344d875\",\"review_text\":\"Sir this days i am facing a lot of login problem from my phone no , please try to update the app and add some option in spotifoty settings to link and show account username . It will be very helpful for every user . \\\"U Can Try A Diffrent Phone Number\\\". Error is coming 😭😭\"},{\"review_id\":\"7add6a62-b949-432a-bd49-9ea0e2a16f22\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad application. Time wasting\"},{\"review_id\":\"b153257f-bf3f-48d9-98a3-08ea3a2c7924\",\"review_text\":\"everything works fine, but would be nice for lossless music streaming edit: just removed adding playlist to queue, and paywalled lyrics\"},{\"review_id\":\"3399a793-d748-480b-88e1-42bb90787e3a\",\"review_text\":\"quick..easy..\"},{\"review_id\":\"986a77c9-c565-40a1-872b-de51c92781dc\",\"review_text\":\"Ad sucks..!! That's why I'm giving 4 stars. Other literally obsessed with this app better than an apple music..!! Wooh! apple shocked Spotify rocked.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3a2a445c-56c1-4125-8fcc-603c7a300b9c\",\"review_text\":\"The worst app\"}]}"
